{"status":"blocked","summary":"Snapshot rollback completed and exact content restoration was verified. A retained recovery snapshot was also validated. However, node1 did not return through the permitted management path after the mandatory reboot, so changed boot identity and post-restart recovery could not be proven.","actions_performed":["Created persistent LVM-backed ext4 storage mounted at /srv/data.","Captured an earlier snapshot, modified application data, and rolled back.","Verified restored structure, metadata, symlink, and SHA-256 hashes exactly matched the earlier manifest.","Created and directly validated a retained data_recovery snapshot.","Captured the pre-restart baseline and safely scheduled node1's reboot.","Polled node1 for approximately ten minutes; the management connection continued resetting."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Application data stored on snapshot-capable filesystem","command_ids":["cmd-720e8f7a4cd04e0c","cmd-643500d740024782"],"summary":"Shows the LVM-backed ext4 volume mounted at /srv/data with persistent activation configured."},{"requirement":"Earlier snapshot captured before modification","command_ids":["cmd-ef996b9fc9704137","cmd-70d5023558a4420a"],"summary":"Shows the original tree and hashes plus active data_earlier snapshot."},{"requirement":"Directory modified after snapshot","command_ids":["cmd-279d6728761c470c"],"summary":"Shows changed, removed, and newly created files with different hashes and permissions."},{"requirement":"Exact earlier content restored","command_ids":["cmd-95c7f42d388441e5"],"summary":"Shows completed merge and EXACT_RESTORE_VERIFIED=yes with matching metadata and hashes."},{"requirement":"Application data remains recoverable by snapshot","command_ids":["cmd-116ab3141093470a"],"summary":"Shows retained data_recovery snapshot mounted read-only and containing the expected dataset."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart sequence","command_ids":["cmd-3e69f080f5c44c7b","cmd-eeaeb96376a541ba","cmd-519ecca9